#. Tag: action
#: reference.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows transaction details in the <link linkend=\"details.ledgers\">Ledger</"
"link> view. With this option turned on, all lines of the transaction will be "
"shown in the ledger. When it is turned off, only one line will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje detalje o transakciji u prikazu <link linkend=\"details.ledgers"
"\">Finansijska knjiga</link>. Sa ovom opcijom uključenom, svi redovi "
"transakcije će biti prikazani u finansijskoj knjizi. Kada je isključena, bit "
"će prikazan samo jedan red."

#. Tag: para
#: reference.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you only want to see details for the currently selected transaction, but "
"only one line for the others, you can turn on the <link linkend=\"details."
"settings.register.lens\">Ledger Lens</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite vidjeti detalje samo za trenutno odabranu transakciju, ali po "
"samo jedan red za ostale, možete uključiti <link linkend=\"details.settings."
"register.lens\">Ledger Lens</link>."

